Ayyyyyy!
Prerequisites: Security 15
Ranks: 1
Benet: You can punch or kick a locked object and
add d10 × 5 to the Security check. However, if successful, this automatically opens the object and is
always noisy.

Battlefield Saint
Prerequisites: Medic 10
Ranks: 3
Benet: Healing wounds under pressure comes naturally to you. Though you gain no bonus to healing
broken limbs or curing other ailments, when successfully performing eld healing, you heal +4 hit points
for every rank of this perk.

Biff !
