Monkeywrench
Prerequisites: Mechanics 15
Ranks: 1
Benet: You know the weaknesses of robots so well
that you gain +4 to damage against them and successful attacks against them are increased by 20 for
purposes of determining critical hits.



Nice Grouping
Prerequisites: Firearms 20
Ranks: 3
Benet: For every rank of this skill, the secondary
and tertiary burst penalties are pushed out one
round. E.g.: On a six round burst, the rst round
would have no penalty, the second would have a 4
