Simple Machines
Prerequisites: Science 20 and IN 7
Ranks: 1
Benet: You are so well versed in the articial intelligence routines of robots that they suer a 4 penalty
to hit you.

Six-Shooter
Prerequisites: Firearms 15 and PE 8
Ranks: 1
Benet: You know that your trusty revolvers won't
