Steady Aim
Prerequisites: Firearms 15 and PE 6
Ranks: 3
Benet: You have the patience to wait for the perfect shot. You may sacrice your move action to aim,
gaining a +2 bonus to hit per rank.


Street Sweeper
Prerequisites: Firearms 20 and ST 6
Ranks: 1
Benet: You know when to hold `em, know when to
fold `em. . . in half with bullets! When making sweep
