Suicide King
Prerequisites: Cult of Personality and Persuasion
10 and CH 8
Ranks: 1
Benet: When standing within your area of inuence, CNPC allies always ignore how wounded they
are when you attempt to control them in combat.


Tech Vulture
Prerequisites: Mechanics 10 and PE 5
Ranks: 1
Benet: Waste not, want not. When you nd a
